  "description": "After being reborn into her favorite novel, Sarah Brant's role was clear. She's a maid, an extra with no other goal than to see her favorite pair from the story get together. Unfortunately, she's constantly walking on egg shells around the fussy prince Leonard who's determined to fire her. Can Sarah keep her job long enough to watch her favorite story's finale from the best seats in the house?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
